# `gotham review --force` writes <review>.json.regenerating beside each review
# and deletes it when the episode lands. It exists only while a re-review is in
# flight, and a snapshot taken mid-run would otherwise commit one.
*.json.regenerating

# The local emulator export `local:up` writes and restores. Never checked in
# (ADR 0060): it is opaque, pinned to an emulator jar version, and rots
# silently against contract changes.
.local-emulator/
# The emulators write their own logs beside whatever directory they start in.
*-debug.log
firebase-export-*/

# The RSA pair Coach Engine's tests sign with, made by `bun run keys:test`.
# Generated rather than committed: push protection refuses a PEM private key,
# and nothing here needs one particular key.
services/coach-engine/certification-fixtures/
